        "* [Pricing](https://github.com/pricing)\n\nSearch or jump to...\n\n# Search code, repositories, users, issues, pull requests...\n\nAppearance settings\n\nResetting focus\n\nwinstonjs / **winston** Public\n\n* [Notifications](https://github.com/login?return_to=%2Fwinstonjs%2Fwinston) You must be signed in to change notification settings\n* [Fork 1\\.8k](https://github.com/login?return_to=%2Fwinstonjs%2Fwinston)\n* [Star 24\\.5k](https://github.com/login?return_to=%2Fwinstonjs%2Fwinston)\n\n* Code\n* [Issues 460](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues)\n* [Pull requests 60](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/pulls)\n* Actions\n* Projects\n* Security and quality\n* Insights\n\n# Log to file fails when using with uncaughtException \\#1781\n\n[New issue](https://github.com/login?return_to=https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n\nCopy link\n\n[New issue](https://github.com/login?return_to=https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n\nCopy link\n\nOpen\n\nOpen\nLog to file fails when using with uncaughtException \\#1781\n\nCopy link\n\n## Description\n\n[@juffalow](https://github.com/juffalow)\n\n[juffalow](https://github.com/juffalow)\n\nopened [on Apr 11, 2020](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n\nIssue body actions\n\n### Please tell us about your environment:\n\n* winston version 3.2.1\n* node version 13.8.0\n* mac os\n* typescript\n\n### What is the problem?\n\nI want to log top level error if occured. My code:\n\n```\nprocess . on ( 'uncaughtException' , ( error ) => { \n  logger . error ( { message : 'Uncaught exception detected!' , error } ) ; \n  logger . on ( 'finish' , ( info ) => { \n    console . log ( 'on finish' , info ) ; \n    process . exit ( 1 ) ; \n  } ) ; \n  logger . end ( ) ; \n } ) ; \n\n process . on ( 'unhandledRejection' , ( error ) => { \n  logger . error ( { message : 'Unhandled rejection detected!' , error } ) ; \n  logger . on ( 'finish' , ( info ) => { \n    console . log ( 'on finish' , info ) ; \n    process . exit ( 1 ) ;\n} ) ; \n  logger . end ( ) ; \n } ) ;\n```\n\nI see the error in console log along with `on finish undefined` .\n\n### What do you expect to happen instead?\n\nLogs the error in a file. Now it logs it just to console.\n\n### Other information\n\nIt works if I do:\n\n```\nprocess . on ( 'uncaughtException' , ( error ) => { \n  logger . error ( { message : 'Uncaught exception detected!' , error } ) ; \n  logger . on ( 'finish' , ( info ) => { \n    console . log ( 'on finish' , info ) ; \n    setTimeout ( ( ) => process . exit ( 1 ) , 100 ) ; \n  } ) ; \n  logger . end ( ) ; \n } ) ; \n\n process . on ( 'unhandledRejection' , ( error ) => { \n  logger . error ( { message : 'Unhandled rejection detected!' , error } ) ; \n  logger . on ( 'finish' , ( info ) => { \n    console . log ( 'on finish' , info ) ; \n    setTimeout ( ( ) => process . exit ( 1 ) , 100 ) ; \n  } ) ; \n  logger . end ( ) ; \n } ) ;\n```\n\n👍 React with 👍 2 wjuly and abbos-yaxyoyev\n\n## Activity\n\n### wjuly commented on May 30, 2020\n\n@wjuly\nwjuly\n\n[on May 30, 2020](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n\nMore actions\n\nI also have this issue. I have been trying to log uncaught exceptions with winston from within the process.on('uncaughtException') event before terminating with process.exit(1). I also tried using winston's exceptionHandlers option and had the same problem: no logs were being created in the appropriate log files by either 'winston-daily-rotate-file' or the built in File transport. Using juffalow's workaround (above) I was able to get my code to work. It would seem that process.exit(1) is being called before winston can finish writing the logs to the files. Oddly, the built in Console transport worked even when 'winston-daily-rotate-file' and the built in File transport did not.\n\nExample code:\n\n`const winston = require('winston') ;`  \n`const { createLogger, format, transports } = require('winston');`  \n`const { combine, timestamp, json, printf, colorize, errors } = format;`\n`const DailyRotateFile = require('winston-daily-rotate-file');`\n\n`const logger = createLogger({`  \n`transports: [`  \n`// Doesn't write logs to files without juffalow's workaround`  \n`new DailyRotateFile({`  \n`level: 'info',`  \n`format: combine(`  \n`timestamp(),`  \n`json()`  \n`),`  \n`filename: '%DATE%.log',`  \n`dirname: 'logs/all',`  \n`datePattern: 'YYYY-MM-DD',`  \n`utc: true,`  \n`zippedArchive: true,`  \n`maxFiles: '30d',`  \n`}),`  \n`// Doesn't write logs to files without juffalow's workaround`  \n`new transports.File({`  \n`filename: 'logs.log',`  \n`level: 'info',`  \n`format: combine(`  \n`timestamp(),`  \n`json()`  \n`)`  \n`}),`  \n`// Works`  \n`new transports.Console({`  \n`level: 'info',`  \n`format: combine(`  \n`colorize(),`  \n`timestamp(),`  \n`)`  \n`})`  \n`],`  \n`});`\n\n`process.on('uncaughtException', (err) => {`  \n`logger.error('There was an uncaught exception: ', err);`  \n`});`\n\n`// \"There was an uncaught exception: Uncaught exception!\n\" logged by Console transport, but not 'winston-daily-rotate-file', or File transport`  \n`throw new Error('Uncaught exception!');`\n\n### wjuly commented on May 30, 2020\n\n@wjuly\n\nwjuly\n\n[on May 30, 2020](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n\nLast edited by wjuly\n\nMore actions\n\nA more concise workaround to this problem:\n\nTheoretically this should work everytime because winston Loggers are treated as Node 'object mode streams' and the logger stream's end() method must be called before the 'finish' event is emitted signifying that all of the stream's data has reached it's destination and no more data will be streamed.\n\n```\nprocess\n  .on('uncaughtException', (err) => {\n    //No need for setTimeout() or calling logger.end() manually as above\n    logger.error('There was an uncaught exception: ', err);\n    logger.on('finish', () => {\n      process.exit(1);\n    });\n    \n})\n```\n\niamFIREcracker\n\nmentioned this [on Oct 20, 2020](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n* [`File` transport stops working on the first uncaught exception \\#1855](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1855)\n\ncoderabbitai\n\nmentioned this [on Jun 25, 2026](https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n\n* [fix(electron): self-heal stale port on launch + graceful EADDRINUSE aaronvstory/image-rotator](https://github.com/aaronvstory/image-rotator/pull/32)\n\n **to join this conversation on GitHub.** Already have an account? [Sign in to comment](https://github.com/login?return_to=https://github.com/winstonjs/winston/issues/1781)\n\n## Metadata\n\n## Metadata\n\n### Assignees\n\nNo one assigned\n\n### Labels\n\nNo labels\n\nNo labels\n\n### Type\n\nNo type\n\n### Fields\n\n[Give feedback](https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/189141)\n\nNo fields configured for issues without a type.\n\n### Projects\n\nNo projects\n\n### Milestone\n\nNo milestone\n\n### Relationships\n\nNone yet\n\n### Development\n\nNo branches or pull requests\n\n### Participants\n\n@juffalow @wjuly\n\n## Issue actions\n\n## Footer"
